WEBVTT

00:00:17.851 --> 00:00:21.719
| don't understand.
| don't understand hearts...

00:00:26.226 --> 00:00:30.129
Your name is Lime, isn't it?
What's wrong? Isn't Otaru with you?

00:00:35.835 --> 00:00:37.132
Did something happen?

00:00:37.203 --> 00:00:39.103
| don't understand anymore...

00:00:39.172 --> 00:00:42.472
Aren't we supposed to be happy
because we have hearts?

00:00:42.642 --> 00:00:45.475
But then, Tiger said she could die
because she has a heart...

00:00:45.545 --> 00:00:47.775
...but if we die, we won't be able
to see our loved ones anymore!

00:00:48.815 --> 00:00:50.977
| don't understand.

00:00:51.051 --> 00:00:55.215
If it's going to be this painful,
I don't want a heart!

00:00:57.190 --> 00:01:00.125
There is a way
to escape your pain.

00:01:27.921 --> 00:01:31.118
| came to this land to protect you.

00:01:31.491 --> 00:01:34.722
| was born to be with you.

00:01:35.095 --> 00:01:38.065
The moment I awoke...

00:01:38.698 --> 00:01:42.157
...prisms surrounded me.

00:01:42.302 --> 00:01:45.567
I'm here to love you now.

00:01:45.939 --> 00:01:49.432
I was born to hold you.

00:01:49.609 --> 00:01:52.579
Lies and truths...

00:01:53.179 --> 00:01:56.774
...are all within ourselves.

00:01:57.617 --> 00:02:01.747
The days I abandon my true feelings...

00:02:01.821 --> 00:02:03.311
...won't get to me.

00:02:03.756 --> 00:02:07.021
Tenderness and caring...

00:02:07.393 --> 00:02:10.419
...can be ours once again!

00:02:10.797 --> 00:02:15.044
Within the eyes
of a puppet on a string.

00:02:15.068 --> 00:02:18.881
Heart shaken by a dream
that someone else contrived for me.

00:02:18.905 --> 00:02:22.284
The courage to discard
the rusted screws...

00:02:22.308 --> 00:02:27.007
...is starting to awaken inside of me.

00:02:37.190 --> 00:02:38.680
Lime!!

00:02:38.758 --> 00:02:40.226
LIME

00:02:44.631 --> 00:02:46.099
Lime!

00:02:48.101 --> 00:02:49.034
Lime!

00:02:49.102 --> 00:02:52.037
Lime, c'mon! Lime!!

00:02:55.208 --> 00:02:56.698
Lime...!

00:02:59.612 --> 00:03:01.740
Her maiden circuit is gone...!

00:03:04.450 --> 00:03:06.748
LIME

00:03:29.642 --> 00:03:34.170
They're saying that a part, from
about this area, was taken from her.

00:03:34.247 --> 00:03:35.942
This area...?

00:03:36.015 --> 00:03:37.915
That would have to be her "heart.”

00:03:37.984 --> 00:03:39.713
Y-You mean...?!

00:03:40.853 --> 00:03:44.084
Someone stole Lime's HEART?!

00:03:48.328 --> 00:03:53.266
Love Unending, Hearts Distant

00:03:54.267 --> 00:03:56.565
At any rate, let's ask around to
every secondhand store, junk shop...

00:03:56.636 --> 00:04:00.038
...and any other place that
might sell used parts.

00:04:00.106 --> 00:04:01.403
Right!

00:04:01.474 --> 00:04:03.442
"Kasahari Apartments”

00:04:15.555 --> 00:04:17.045
We're counting on you!

00:04:19.559 --> 00:04:21.823
We really appreciate this,
Master Obiichi.

00:04:21.894 --> 00:04:25.159
The more people involved in a search,
the greater the odds of success.

00:04:25.231 --> 00:04:27.529
Once I am finished here,
| will join in the search as well.

00:04:27.600 --> 00:04:30.399
Thanks. All right,
let's get going!

00:04:31.604 --> 00:04:32.615
Otaru.

00:04:32.639 --> 00:04:34.733
What're you doing here, Otaru?

00:04:35.174 --> 00:04:37.643
| want to help look for it, too...

00:04:37.710 --> 00:04:41.943
You ninny! I told you
to stay in the apartment!

00:04:42.015 --> 00:04:44.848
Do you want her to be
all alone?! Go back!

00:04:44.917 --> 00:04:45.828
But I...

00:04:45.852 --> 00:04:48.822
Just go back!
Come on. Let's go, Hanagata.

00:04:52.525 --> 00:04:55.825
Otaru, don't worry.
| will find the maiden circuit...

00:04:56.763 --> 00:04:58.424
...for your sake.

00:04:58.498 --> 00:05:00.432
Give me a break...

00:05:00.500 --> 00:05:01.990
Hey, wait for me!!

00:05:04.570 --> 00:05:06.163
Go home.

00:05:06.239 --> 00:05:07.536
Master...

00:05:07.607 --> 00:05:09.598
But... Even if I do go back...

00:05:10.643 --> 00:05:12.111
...what good will it do?

00:05:12.178 --> 00:05:14.909
Lime is Lime. Am I wrong?

00:05:17.684 --> 00:05:21.143
Go. She is waiting for you.

00:05:36.269 --> 00:05:39.432
"O-Taru"

00:05:41.708 --> 00:05:43.176
I'm home.

00:05:49.115 --> 00:05:50.583
Lime...

00:05:52.485 --> 00:05:53.953
0-Oh, yeah.

00:05:57.190 --> 00:05:59.158
Here. It's for you.

00:06:14.073 --> 00:06:15.563
Oh, really?

00:06:15.641 --> 00:06:17.973
You got a hold of a
maiden circuit, you say?

00:06:18.678 --> 00:06:20.043
Yes, fuhrer.

00:06:20.113 --> 00:06:24.573
Well done, Rubens. I will
send someone to collect it.

00:06:24.650 --> 00:06:25.515
Yes, sir.

00:06:25.585 --> 00:06:27.576
I'm sure you already understand this...

00:06:27.653 --> 00:06:31.317
...but don't think of doing
anything foolish, Rubens...

00:06:31.391 --> 00:06:33.485
...or, should I say,
Soemon Obiichi.

00:06:33.860 --> 00:06:36.022
| would never, Lord Faust.

00:06:47.206 --> 00:06:49.174
"Foolish..."

00:07:00.787 --> 00:07:03.347
"O-Taru"

00:07:03.823 --> 00:07:06.292
Nothing? I see.

00:07:06.826 --> 00:07:08.521
I'm sorry.

00:07:08.594 --> 00:07:10.119
We'll go make the rounds again!

00:07:10.196 --> 00:07:11.789
No, wait!

00:07:11.864 --> 00:07:13.764
Aren't you hungry?

00:07:14.233 --> 00:07:17.430
You must be starving after
all of that running around.

00:07:17.503 --> 00:07:20.268
Have a bite to eat first.
I'll make something for you.

00:07:20.840 --> 00:07:23.207
Please, Master Otaru...
Let me do that...

00:07:23.276 --> 00:07:26.803
Don't sweat it! I've been
wanting something to do.

00:07:29.282 --> 00:07:33.082
Now, I am Soemon Obiichi no longer.

00:07:33.586 --> 00:07:36.578
| am Rubens, loyal retainer to
Faust, the fuhrer of Gartlant.

00:07:37.223 --> 00:07:39.157
| am Rubens!

00:07:47.266 --> 00:07:48.700
It's dark here.

00:07:48.768 --> 00:07:51.965
Where am |? What happened to me?

00:07:59.245 --> 00:08:02.146
If someone is kind to you,
it isn't always love.

00:08:02.215 --> 00:08:04.582
If someone holds you,
it isn't always love!

00:08:09.222 --> 00:08:12.419
For Lord Faust, I would
defeat you, even if it killed me.

00:08:13.559 --> 00:08:15.493
But, why...?

00:08:15.561 --> 00:08:17.996
Why would you want to die if
you have someone to live for?

00:08:19.232 --> 00:08:21.132
Because I have a heart.

00:08:21.200 --> 00:08:22.565
Because...?!

00:08:22.635 --> 00:08:24.296
Lord Faust...

00:08:30.176 --> 00:08:32.235
It's painful...
It's painful, isn't it...?

00:08:34.113 --> 00:08:35.603
...Lime.

00:08:36.582 --> 00:08:38.812
Who's there?

00:08:38.885 --> 00:08:42.981
It's really, really painful.
| feel so sad, so awful inside...

00:08:43.055 --> 00:08:44.716
I don't want to feel this way!

00:08:45.224 --> 00:08:47.056
If I have to feel this way...

00:08:47.126 --> 00:08:49.652
...I don't want a heart at all!!

00:08:55.234 --> 00:08:58.932
C'mon, dig in! I doubt it's as
good as Cherry's cooking, though.

00:08:59.005 --> 00:09:00.473
- R-Right...
- 0-Okay...

00:09:06.579 --> 00:09:08.547
C'mon, Lime. You, too.

00:09:11.217 --> 00:09:12.776
Eat up!

00:09:12.852 --> 00:09:15.253
| even made your favorite
boiled potatoes.

00:09:21.527 --> 00:09:23.086
Aw, man...

00:09:23.162 --> 00:09:26.462
What, did you forget how to
handle things gently, too?

00:09:26.532 --> 00:09:29.331
All right... Here, use mine.

00:09:30.836 --> 00:09:32.395
Otaru...

00:09:33.205 --> 00:09:34.331
Lime?

00:09:34.407 --> 00:09:37.399
Is this how you want it to be?
Don't you want to go back?

00:09:38.844 --> 00:09:39.902
Otaru...!

00:09:43.816 --> 00:09:45.045
Lime...?

00:09:45.117 --> 00:09:47.711
No... I don't want to go back.

00:10:14.213 --> 00:10:15.874
Koyuki.

00:10:21.587 --> 00:10:24.522
Were you lonely, Koyuki?

00:10:38.471 --> 00:10:40.439
"Secondhand Store"

00:10:50.149 --> 00:10:53.585
We were destined
to meet on that day...

00:11:00.192 --> 00:11:03.287
...but no one in society,
not a single soul...

00:11:03.362 --> 00:11:05.922
...would accept us for what we were.

00:11:11.537 --> 00:11:12.800
You shameless dog!

00:11:12.872 --> 00:11:15.307
Lousy marionette lover!

00:11:15.374 --> 00:11:17.342
We don't want your kind
around here, freak!

00:11:21.213 --> 00:11:22.681
Damn!

00:11:38.597 --> 00:11:40.725
Chased out of Japoness...

00:11:41.033 --> 00:11:43.502
...we wandered around aimlessly...

00:11:43.569 --> 00:11:46.539
...until we finally found ourselves...

00:11:46.605 --> 00:11:48.232
...in Gartlant.

00:12:21.607 --> 00:12:24.042
| will never forget
the shock I felt then...

00:12:24.110 --> 00:12:27.774
A marionette actually SMILED...
..like a human being!

00:12:27.847 --> 00:12:30.111
...through the magic
known as a "maiden circuit."

00:12:32.651 --> 00:12:37.452
Lord Faust rescued me from
dying like a dog on the street.

00:12:38.858 --> 00:12:43.125
That is why I pledged my
lifetime's allegiance to him.

00:12:44.830 --> 00:12:48.061
But now, I have the magic box
before my very eyes.

00:12:48.134 --> 00:12:50.034
A maiden circuit...

00:12:50.102 --> 00:12:54.562
| will put this inside of you
for only a little while.

00:12:55.841 --> 00:12:58.811
The fuhrer will surely forgive
me for my indescretion...

00:13:02.581 --> 00:13:04.572
Just once...

00:13:04.650 --> 00:13:09.383
...if only for an instant,
| want to see you smile.

00:13:10.589 --> 00:13:12.921
| will erase the data contained
inside this maiden circuit...

00:13:12.992 --> 00:13:14.756
...and put it into you.

00:13:15.628 --> 00:13:17.687
It won't be long now, Koyuki...

00:13:46.859 --> 00:13:48.293
Otaru...

00:13:50.963 --> 00:13:51.953
Lime...?

00:13:52.565 --> 00:13:55.125
| want to keep
smiling forever...

00:13:55.201 --> 00:13:58.227
I don't want to feel sad.

00:13:58.304 --> 00:14:00.500
And that's why you
don't want a heart...?

00:14:00.573 --> 00:14:02.166
Don't you want
to go back...?

00:14:02.241 --> 00:14:06.007
If 1 go back, something
painful will happen again!

00:14:06.078 --> 00:14:08.206
I don't want
anyone else to die...

00:14:08.280 --> 00:14:09.941
I don't, not ever again!

00:14:10.449 --> 00:14:12.747
I know exactly how you feel...

00:14:12.818 --> 00:14:14.729
...but, do you
know what, Lime?

00:14:14.753 --> 00:14:17.723
That's what it's like
to have a heart.

00:14:17.790 --> 00:14:19.758
It means that
you are alive.

00:14:21.760 --> 00:14:24.457
You're the girl from
Grampa leyasu's picture...

00:14:24.797 --> 00:14:26.561
Lime...

00:14:26.632 --> 00:14:28.726
If you stay here...

00:14:28.801 --> 00:14:31.600
...if your heart and body are
separated from each other...

00:14:31.670 --> 00:14:34.196
...you'll never have to go
through pain ever again.

00:14:34.840 --> 00:14:38.708
But, if you do that,
you'll never see Otaru ever again.

00:14:39.678 --> 00:14:41.578
In exchange for escaping
from the pain...

00:14:41.647 --> 00:14:44.708
...you will lose
all contact with him.

00:14:48.053 --> 00:14:50.647
Is that what you
really want, Lime...?

00:14:50.723 --> 00:14:52.191
Otaru...

00:14:59.064 --> 00:15:01.431
What are you doing, Otaru?!

00:15:01.500 --> 00:15:03.491
Come on, it can't be in there...

00:15:04.036 --> 00:15:07.131
HAVE YOU LOOKED IN HERE?!!
Have any of you looked in here?!!

00:15:14.680 --> 00:15:16.478
Otaru!

00:15:16.548 --> 00:15:18.038
Are you all right, Otaru?!

00:15:20.653 --> 00:15:23.520
Let go! Let go of me
Goddammit...

00:15:23.589 --> 00:15:25.318
LET ME GO

00:15:27.092 --> 00:15:28.082
Otaru...

00:15:48.514 --> 00:15:50.539
- What?!
- It's Lime!

00:15:50.616 --> 00:15:54.075
"Ready to delete."

00:15:54.920 --> 00:15:56.888
It won't be much
longer now, Koyuki.

00:16:00.159 --> 00:16:02.127
I'm home.

00:16:04.897 --> 00:16:06.365
I'm home.

00:16:09.134 --> 00:16:10.568
Lime...

00:16:20.612 --> 00:16:24.674
Otaru's crying.
Otaru's crying for me!

00:16:24.750 --> 00:16:26.275
Lime...

00:16:42.234 --> 00:16:43.861
| want to go back!

00:16:43.936 --> 00:16:46.962
| want to go back to Otaru!

00:16:47.239 --> 00:16:50.539
You have someone who
can share your pain...

00:16:50.609 --> 00:16:52.634
Try to live with him...

00:16:52.711 --> 00:16:55.180
...and with your heart, Lime...

00:16:58.283 --> 00:17:01.082
OTARUM

00:17:04.490 --> 00:17:05.480
Lime?!

00:17:08.594 --> 00:17:10.358
W-What on earth?!

00:17:18.771 --> 00:17:20.398
Forgive me, Lime!

00:17:21.073 --> 00:17:22.165
Select delete option: 1) All
data 2) Selected data 3) Cancel

00:17:25.210 --> 00:17:26.268
You!

00:17:26.345 --> 00:17:28.746
- Master Obiichi!
- It was you?!

00:17:32.351 --> 00:17:36.219
Do not get in our way,
or I will destroy it!

00:17:36.288 --> 00:17:37.756
Let's go, Koyuki.

00:17:46.865 --> 00:17:48.594
- Otaru...
- Master?!

00:17:53.739 --> 00:17:55.400
Master... What's going on?

00:18:02.881 --> 00:18:04.679
You've got to be kidding...

00:18:08.587 --> 00:18:10.521
Why did you do it, Master?

00:18:10.589 --> 00:18:13.559
I can't believe it.
Someone like you would never...

00:18:14.493 --> 00:18:15.983
Don't say it!

00:18:17.863 --> 00:18:20.594
But why, Master?!
Why would you work for Gartlant?!

00:18:21.100 --> 00:18:23.091
You should already know
the answer to that!

00:18:24.736 --> 00:18:27.569
Are marionettes machines?
Just mindless puppets?!

00:18:28.507 --> 00:18:32.000
No. Even if they cannot
speak for themselves...

00:18:32.077 --> 00:18:35.069
...even if they cannot smile,
THEY ARE ALIVE!

00:18:35.848 --> 00:18:39.045
She is alive!
My Koyuki lives!!!

00:18:40.886 --> 00:18:43.412
| want her to have a smile...

00:18:43.489 --> 00:18:45.116
...if only for a fleeting moment!

00:18:45.190 --> 00:18:46.487
Master...

00:18:46.558 --> 00:18:49.118
That is why I need
the maiden circuit!

00:18:49.194 --> 00:18:50.684
For Koyuki!!

00:18:58.437 --> 00:19:00.462
I know how you feel...

00:19:00.539 --> 00:19:02.564
...but I can't let you have it!

00:19:03.175 --> 00:19:06.475
| can't sacrifice Lime for you!!

00:19:13.852 --> 00:19:15.479
Master Otaru!

00:19:15.554 --> 00:19:16.544
Otaru!!

00:19:16.622 --> 00:19:18.090
Stay out of it

00:19:36.542 --> 00:19:38.533
Koyuki™
Pick it up and run'"!

00:19:43.515 --> 00:19:45.176
Good, Koyuki! Now, run!!

00:19:51.190 --> 00:19:52.680
KOYUKI!™

00:19:55.827 --> 00:19:57.454
Death to all traitors!

00:20:22.321 --> 00:20:23.789
Koyuki...

00:20:24.990 --> 00:20:26.719
Master...

00:20:50.082 --> 00:20:51.550
Please.

00:21:00.225 --> 00:21:01.693
That should do it.

00:21:12.304 --> 00:21:13.703
Lime...

00:21:18.210 --> 00:21:19.678
OTARU...!

00:21:23.715 --> 00:21:25.513
Welcome back.

00:21:25.584 --> 00:21:27.746
I'm sorry, Otaru...

00:21:27.819 --> 00:21:31.517
I'll never try to
leave you again!

00:21:31.590 --> 00:21:34.958
I'll never leave you again, ever!
For the rest of my life...!

00:21:35.027 --> 00:21:36.504
Lime...

00:21:36.528 --> 00:21:39.589
Of course not.
We'll always be together!

00:21:40.232 --> 00:21:41.893
Always, you got that?

00:21:51.510 --> 00:21:55.469
At one time, he could
have been Master Otaru...

00:22:28.213 --> 00:22:31.911
When you're sad, when you're blue...

00:22:31.983 --> 00:22:35.647
...don't go off to be alone.

00:22:35.787 --> 00:22:38.688
Just think of me...

00:22:38.757 --> 00:22:43.354
...and I'll be there with you.

00:22:43.562 --> 00:22:47.328
Strength is a very important thing...

00:22:47.399 --> 00:22:51.063
...but tears are important, too.

00:22:51.236 --> 00:22:55.016
You can't do anything at all...

00:22:55.040 --> 00:22:56.818
...with a dried-up heart.

00:22:56.842 --> 00:23:00.836
You can't feel a thing.

00:23:02.914 --> 00:23:05.246
Tell me, why do people hide...

00:23:05.317 --> 00:23:10.278
...what they really feel inside?

00:23:10.455 --> 00:23:14.085
Take what you can do,
what you want to do...

00:23:14.259 --> 00:23:17.923
...one step at a time.

00:23:18.130 --> 00:23:21.809
I love the way you don't care...

00:23:21.833 --> 00:23:25.633
...how you have been
programmed to live.

00:23:25.771 --> 00:23:29.298
| would follow you anywhere.

00:23:29.674 --> 00:23:36.637
I'll never, ever let you go.

00:23:44.423 --> 00:23:45.720
Yoo-hoo! It's me, Lime!

00:23:45.791 --> 00:23:47.782
Yay, yay! A barbecue, a barbecue!

00:23:47.859 --> 00:23:50.988
A big, all-the-steak-you-
can-eat barbecue party"

00:23:51.062 --> 00:23:54.589
Gartlant seems to be doing some weird
experiments, but let's ignore 'em!

00:23:54.666 --> 00:23:58.102
HEY! That's not very nice, Otaru!
Where did you go to, without me?!

00:23:58.570 --> 00:24:00.368
Huh? I don't get a present?

00:24:00.439 --> 00:24:02.567
But you got presents for
Cherry and Bloodberry"

00:24:02.641 --> 00:24:04.234
How come?

00:24:04.309 --> 00:24:08.610
The Big Barbecue Party Of Darkness
And Light Next on Saber Marionette J!

00:24:08.680 --> 00:24:10.375
I love you, Otaru!
